{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_no",
      "hash": "a0daaf066ccf7654",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……那只同行宝可梦\\n可能比较困难呢。\\c\\n你还是\\n带着别的宝可梦再来吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_01",
      "hash": "a219e9066dde7cd4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！宝可梦趴在你身上，\\n真的好可爱呀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_02",
      "hash": "a219ec066dde81ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可是对我来说可能有点重呢！\\n所以我才让宝可梦跟着我一起走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub089_poke_01",
      "hash": "c5112ae0eeabb71c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "走路草：来走～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub089_sys_01",
      "hash": "a5d2d2d2dfdd9d82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "先在[VAR COLOR(0006)]Ｘ菜单[VAR COLOR(0000)]的同行宝可梦中\\n选择宝可梦。\\c\\n点选“[VAR COLOR(0006)]从球里放出[VAR COLOR(0000)]”后，\\n你就可以和它一起走路了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_03",
      "hash": "a219eb066dde803a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "保证很可爱啦！\\n我来帮你弄！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_04",
      "hash": "a219e6066dde77bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要能和宝可梦一起，\\n哪怕只是走路都好开心呢！\\r\\n……你肯定早就知道了吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_089_max",
      "hash": "e356cfde9ef85cf9"
    }
  ]
}
